  "body": "`fetch client settings object` argument of\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#internal-module-script-graph-fetching-procedure\r\nis only used for top-level module script, and submodules are loaded using `module map settings object`, because https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#fetch-the-descendants-of-a-module-script Step 7 passes `module script's settings object` (which is `module map settings object`) as both of \"fetch client SO\" and \"module map SO\".\r\n\r\nI expect fetch client settings object should also be used for fetching submodules.\r\nParticularly, `outsideSettings` should be used as fetch client's settings object for fetching the whole module script graph for worklets (at least according to the current spec, as `insideSettings` can't be used for fetching).",
